+	# ═══════ [MP8] 2026-08-19 fix - the fail alert sound is only triggered by the server ═══════
+	# This function is called by `kill_rpc` (a call_local broadcast), so all 8 peers run it.
+	# Previously each of the 8 peers broadcast `play_omni_rpc.rpc()` on its own → every peer received 8 copies,
